  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "source": "## 2.4 Preparación de epochs alineados del paciente muestra",
   "metadata": {
    "_cell_guid": "6ae649a0-043b-4f8c-883a-8c18ee3036b5",
    "_uuid": "e9b8926d-3233-4572-9271-1dbb5e1f733e",
